WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:23.070
The king paced up and down the Throne Room.

2
00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:26.788
"I wish my mother would leave," he said.

3
00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:30.126
"She's making everyone unhappy."

4
00:00:30.127 --> 00:00:32.376
"Wizard!" Dirk snapped.

5
00:00:32.377 --> 00:00:34.661
"Did you find a magic spell?"

6
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:37.440
Tom shook his head. "No, but—"

7
00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:41.252
"Fix this mess, Wizard!" Dirk said.

8
00:00:41.253 --> 00:00:45.405
Tom gulped and took out his wand.

9
00:00:45.406 --> 00:00:53.794
Just then Cat ran into the room.

10
00:00:53.795 --> 00:00:58.355
"Tom!" she said. "Try this instead!"

11
00:00:58.356 --> 00:01:00.671
Tom blinked.

12
00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:03.099
Cat had the wishing cap!

13
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.968
"How did you get that?" Tom asked.

14
00:01:05.969 --> 00:01:08.536
"I took it," Cat said.

15
00:01:08.537 --> 00:01:13.552
"But hurry! The royal grandmother is chasing me!"

16
00:01:13.553 --> 00:01:18.656
Tom put on the wishing cap.

17
00:01:18.657 --> 00:01:23.131
"I wish to undo all of the royal grandmother's wishes!"

18
00:01:23.132 --> 00:01:26.271
Poof!

19
00:01:26.272 --> 00:01:31.193
The king sat on his throne.

20
00:01:31.194 --> 00:01:36.585
Food appeared in the kitchen.

21
00:01:36.586 --> 00:01:42.910
The tiger was gone.

22
00:01:42.911 --> 00:01:47.184
"Tom!" The royal grandmother burst into the Throne Room.

23
00:01:47.185 --> 00:01:49.835
Tom quickly made one more wish.

24
00:01:49.836 --> 00:01:55.989
"I wish this wasn't a wishing cap!"

25
00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:59.971
"That's my cap!" cried the royal grandmother.

26
00:01:59.972 --> 00:02:01.979
She snatched the cap.

27
00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:07.393
"I wish to send Tom to the Grim Dungeon!" she said.

28
00:02:07.394 --> 00:02:09.615
Nothing happened.

29
00:02:09.616 --> 00:02:12.980
The royal grandmother stomped her foot.

30
00:02:12.981 --> 00:02:19.606
"I am very unhappy! I'm leaving at once!"

31
00:02:19.607 --> 00:02:26.383
She marched away.

32
00:02:26.384 --> 00:02:35.448
"Hooray!" the king shouted. "I got my wish!"

33
00:02:35.449 --> 00:02:40.315
"Hmpf!" Dirk snorted.

34
00:02:40.316 --> 00:02:42.973
Tom smiled.

35
00:02:42.974 --> 00:02:48.940
And Cat purred.
